      <section id="about" class="about-area">
                  <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
               <h1 class="section-name" style="color: #2c5f2d">About Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West Project</h1>
               <div class="col-lg-7">
                  <div id="abt-text" class="abt-txt-area">
                     <p><strong>Jaswanti Jewel Chhatrapati Shivaji Road</strong> is a Project by <strong>Ashray Group</strong> situated in the most premium location of <strong>Kandivali West</strong>, Chhatrapati Shivaji Road, offers <strong>2, 3, 4 and 5 BHK</strong> Flats with the availability of Jodi Apartments. Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheet, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities &amp; Specifications. Ashray Group Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West is an Exclusive Tower of <strong>G + 37</strong> <strong>Storey</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West offers 2 BHK apartments starting from 726 Sqft carpet area and 3 BHK apartments starting from 1006 Sqft carpet area. Jaswanti Jewel MahaRERA Number P51800048817.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Jaswanti Jewel Ashray Group Kandivali West Property Features <strong>Amenities</strong> like&nbsp;Arrival Lobby, Automated Car Parking, Global-styled Gym, Yoga Studio, Spa &amp; Salon, Steam Room, AV Room, Multipurpose Court on Ground Level, Games’ Arena, Infinity Pool, Jacuzzi, Food Serving Area, Juice Serving Area, Zen Garden, Senior Citizen Area, Open-Air Theatre, E.V. Charging Points, 3-tier Security System, Fire Fighting Systems, Cafe with Waiting Lounge. Jaswanti Jewel Chhatrapati Shivaji Road Has <strong>Excellent Connectivity</strong> Lotus Multispeciality Hospital - 3 Mins, Oscar Hospital - 8 Mins, Namaha Healthcare - 10 Mins, Tunga Hospital - 10 Mins, Thakur International School - 3 Mins, Atharva College - 5 Mins, KES International School - 5 Mins, Billabong High International School - 7 Mins, Ryan International School - 7 Mins, Kapol Vidhyanidhi International School - 7 Mins, Witty International School - 8 Mins, Croma - 5 Mins, Infiniti Mall - 7 Mins, D Mart - 10 Mins, Raghuleela Mall - 12 Mins, Inorbit Mall - 12 Mins, Growel's 101 Mall - 15 Mins, Oberoi Mall - 15 Mins. Business Hubs - Mindspace - 10 Mins, Mindspace - 10 Mins.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Jaswanti Jewel <strong>address</strong> is Jaswanti Jewel, Chhatrapati Shivaji Road, Off M G Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai - 400067.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Ashray Group</strong> has many ongoing, upcoming &amp; completed Projects&nbsp;Jaswanti Jewel, Jaswanti Bliss, Jaswanti Landmark, Jaswanti Gold, Jaswanti Garden, Jaswanti Woods, Jaswanti Allied Business Centre, Smruti, Raj Chambers, Dayal Smruti, Minarette</p>                  </div>
                
               </div>
               <div class="col-lg-5">
                  <div class="abt-img-area">
                     <img src="https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/image1783233218.jpg" alt="Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West_ Elevation Image">
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </section>
